---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Affiliate & Advertising Disclosure — UniqueDigit" description="Full transparency regarding affiliate relationships, EarnKaro, and monetization on UniqueDigit.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 prose text-ink">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">Transparency First</p>

    <p>
      In compliance with advertising standards and consumer protection guidelines, UniqueDigit provides the following disclosure concerning monetization practices:
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links & Commissions</h2>
    <p>
      UniqueDigit participates in various affiliate marketing programs, including EarnKaro, Amazon Associates, and direct merchant partnerships. This means that when you click on certain product links, tools, or deal banners and complete a purchase, we may earn an affiliate commission.
    </p>

    <h2>Zero Extra Cost to You</h2>
    <p>
      This commission is paid directly by the retail merchants and comes at <strong>zero additional cost</strong> to you as a consumer. In many instances, our deals and coupons offer a discount compared to direct list prices.
    </p>

    <h2>Editorial Independence</h2>
    <p>
      Our editorial benchmark verdicts and hardware recommendations are never influenced by affiliate partnerships. We recommend gear and tools solely based on verified performance, specs, and price-to-performance value.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
